00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:54.040
This murder mystery thriller follows the story of a dude who has the innate ability

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:57.940
of being sent back in time before major accidents occur in order to prevent them.

00:01:57.940 --> 00:02:00.000
After being wrongfully accused of murdering his mom

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:03.490
he's sent back to his childhood where he tries to prevent a series of child murders and

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:06.020
find out who the real culprit was all those years ago,

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.120
in Netflix's

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:10.760
MAKING A MURDERER BUT WITH TIME TRAVEL BULLSHIT COZ IT'S ANIME

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:15.260
This genuinely interesting concept had the community gripped every week waiting for new developments

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:17.840
even if there are some small things off with the writing

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:22.240
several of the kids acted and talked like mature adults instead of being, like, you know

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:23.980
annoying as fuck kids.

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:28.760
Leading to some genuinely awkward moments of a mentally 29 year old guy having romantic tensions

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:30.040
