00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:36.520
But it can sometimes be overlooked when you remember the dark themes of the show

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:38.280
and the events that the kids have to endure.

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:45.940
*ONE PUNCH!!!!*

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:48.540
