00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:51.040
ended up being more predictable than an average fucking episode of

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:51.860
of Scooby-Doo.

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:55.160
Which led to a rather weak and cheesy ending compared to the great build-up

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:57.220
